# Crafted Corsair Artifact (hidden quest CorArtifact), the Bottes (Option 2, Bastok Mines' blue door): a level 99
# Warrior in Nashmau. Against All Odds available: the check fails: Leleroon's default 264. Accepted (a GM): 282 ([1]
# 0, [7] 0), finished on 0: nothing; again, on 2: the blue letter, Option 2, Prog 1, Timer 0. Prog 1: 286. Bastok
# Mines, the blue door (the zone's only Door_House, so the npc:getID() test always holds: its else is waived): a trade
# at Prog 1: nothing; the letter: 519 (Prog 2, the letter taken); 520; the four materials: 521 (taken, Prog 3); 535;
# four Imperial Mythril Pieces: 524 (taken, Prog 4, Timer tomorrow, mustZone); 523 (not yet); the Timer past (a GM)
# but not zoned: 523; zoned: 522 (the Bottes; Completed bit 1, Prog, Option, Timer 0); the Timer set to today counts
# as past. Nashmau: 282 ([1] 1, [7] 4), finished on 2 (the Bottes made): nothing.
lists Nashmau/Leleroon/onTrigger Nashmau/onEventFinish/282 BastokMines/Door_House/onTrigger BastokMines/Door_House/onTrade BastokMines/onEventFinish/519 BastokMines/onEventFinish/521 BastokMines/onEventFinish/522 BastokMines/onEventFinish/524
char zone=Nashmau pos=-14.7,0,26.6 job=WAR lvl=99
item MythrilSheet
item SquareOfKarakulLeather
item SquareOfLmBuffaloLeather
item SquareOfWolfFelt
item ImperialMythrilPiece x4
login
trigger Leleroon                        # Against All Odds available: the check fails: 264
finish
warp 10.4,-1,-16 BastokMines            # beside the blue door
trigger Door_House                      # the check fails: this Door_House has no default: nothing plays
trade Door_House ImperialMythrilPiece x4   # the check fails: nothing
warp -14.7,0,26.6 Nashmau
quest AhtUrhgan.AgainstAllOdds accepted # a GM
trigger Leleroon                        # Prog 0: 282 ([1] 0, [7] 0)
finish option=0                         # not 1-3: nothing
trigger Leleroon                        # 282
finish option=4                         # not 1-3: nothing
trigger Leleroon                        # 282
finish option=2                         # the blue letter; Option 2, Prog 1, Timer 0
trigger Leleroon                        # Prog 1, Option 2: 286
finish
warp 10.4,-1,-16 BastokMines            # beside the blue door
trade Door_House MythrilSheet x1 SquareOfKarakulLeather x1 SquareOfLmBuffaloLeather x1 SquareOfWolfFelt x1   # Prog 1: nothing
trigger Door_House                      # the letter: 519
finish                                  # Prog 2, the letter taken
trigger Door_House                      # Prog 2: 520
finish
trade Door_House ImperialMythrilPiece x4   # Prog 2, not the materials: nothing
trade Door_House MythrilSheet x1 SquareOfKarakulLeather x1 SquareOfLmBuffaloLeather x1 SquareOfWolfFelt x1   # 521
finish                                  # taken, Prog 3
trigger Door_House                      # Prog 3: 535
finish
trade Door_House ImperialMythrilPiece x3   # Prog 3, not the four: nothing
trade Door_House ImperialMythrilPiece x4   # 524
finish                                  # taken, Prog 4, Timer tomorrow, mustZone
trigger Door_House                      # Prog 4, the day not past: 523
finish
charvar HQuest[CorArtifact]Timer 0      # a GM: the day past
trigger Door_House                      # not zoned: 523
finish
charvar HQuest[CorArtifact]Timer 8000   # a GM: the Timer is today (the check is Timer <= today)
warp -14.7,0,26.6 Nashmau
warp 10.4,-1,-16 BastokMines
trigger Door_House                      # 522
finish                                  # the Bottes; Completed 2; Prog, Option, Timer 0
warp -14.7,0,26.6 Nashmau
trigger Leleroon                        # Prog 0, Completed 2: 282 ([1] 1, [7] 4)
finish option=2                         # the Bottes made: nothing
